diff --git a/src/CKRasterizer/CKSdlGpuRasterizer/Rasterizer/CKSdlGpuRasterizerDepthDump.cpp b/src/CKRasterizer/CKSdlGpuRasterizer/Rasterizer/CKSdlGpuRasterizerDepthDump.cpp
